{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inspired by Balatro, Slay the Spire, and Vampire Survivors, <strong>The Cascadier</strong> blends coin-pusher chaos with roguelike deckbuilding. Charge coins with elemental abilities, drop them into evolving pinball-style cabinets, and trigger explosive chain reactions.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/142653db4a519d26934247b6f13cf8ad.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/142653db4a519d26934247b6f13cf8ad.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span>In the pouring rain, a shrouded custodian beckons you inside. Here you\u2019ll meet Fortuna, a mischievous goddess of fortune, and her irritating brother Theodan, god of the time between seconds. Their sibling rivalry spills into every machine and powers that shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, you must beat every cabinet, master the cascades, and claim the title of <i>The Cascadier!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/90d5a2199dfa910d5e0b27be940a22b1.poster.avif?t=1762922551\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/90d5a2199dfa910d5e0b27be940a22b1.webm?t=1762922551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/e3cf7f68cfec4c460b957984a9ea3e09.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/e3cf7f68cfec4c460b957984a9ea3e09.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br>A twist on deckbuilders \u2014 The Cascadier turns your deck into explosive coin powers inside magical arcade machines. Charge your coins with elemental powers and unleash devastating combos with the powers of the gods. Combine them to create synergies and smash the coin shelves apart with Fireballs, Frostbolts, lightning, windy blasts, and light/dark empowered abilities.<i> </i> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/2fa98ff5a5a5a0b78a8f54c4104b225c.poster.avif?t=1762922551\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/2fa98ff5a5a5a0b78a8f54c4104b225c.webm?t=1762922551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/4809d73fbe637e219acde7f9fadb1e8a.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/4809d73fbe637e219acde7f9fadb1e8a.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each machine is an evolving pinball table packed with hidden ramps, mystery slots, and magical bumpers.\u00a0 Earn tickets with every run to unlock <strong>Trinkets</strong> hidden across the machines. Each one grants elemental-infused bonuses you can upgrade permanently through a skill tree, ensuring long-term progression. Stack multiple Trinkets to forge stronger builds and push toward the final machine where Fortuna, the Goddess of Fortune, awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/2dd357e24037eb4e0e958797cd1dc854.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/2dd357e24037eb4e0e958797cd1dc854.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The very first coin Fortuna gives you is unlike any other. It <strong>gains experience each time you win it back out of the machine</strong>, permanently unlocking new powers as it grows. This coin journeys through every cabinet, evolving with you across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To level it up, you\u2019ll need to <strong>win it back before each round ends</strong>\u2014a risky challenge that makes every playthrough feel fresh. Don\u2019t panic, though, the First Coin is never lost in a machine\u2014it always returns at the end of a run, stronger if you have earned it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/98e7ff3c98bd2022e5865a4dcae7dea6.poster.avif?t=1762922551\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/98e7ff3c98bd2022e5865a4dcae7dea6.webm?t=1762922551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/5db1e1ea42f82192db60c6c8a1f049eb.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/5db1e1ea42f82192db60c6c8a1f049eb.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the sweet spot and trigger Euphoria Mode\u2014a chaotic burst of unlimited coins, skyrocketing scores, pulsing music, and dazzling effects. Every machine has its own theme and spectacle, so each burst of Euphoria feels wild in its own way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553150?t=1762922551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/246cb3451e4e6060ac51d23daa91f87c363a98c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762922551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/af01fb34d3b769e478a3e7031506d16f9bca0d89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762922551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/af01fb34d3b769e478a3e7031506d16f9bca0d89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762922551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>PLAY THE FREE DEMO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/5efc1488eb7882e7f8a8346ad564db84.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/5efc1488eb7882e7f8a8346ad564db84.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want to hear your thoughts and be brutal; we can take it! We want to make the best possible Coin Cascade Arcade experience we can, and the only way to do that is with your help!\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inspired by Balatro, Slay the Spire, and Vampire Survivors, <strong>The Cascadier</strong> blends coin-pusher chaos with roguelike deckbuilding. Charge coins with elemental abilities, drop them into evolving pinball-style cabinets, and trigger explosive chain reactions.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/142653db4a519d26934247b6f13cf8ad.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/142653db4a519d26934247b6f13cf8ad.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span>In the pouring rain, a shrouded custodian beckons you inside. Here you\u2019ll meet Fortuna, a mischievous goddess of fortune, and her irritating brother Theodan, god of the time between seconds. Their sibling rivalry spills into every machine and powers that shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, you must beat every cabinet, master the cascades, and claim the title of <i>The Cascadier!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/90d5a2199dfa910d5e0b27be940a22b1.poster.avif?t=1762922551\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/90d5a2199dfa910d5e0b27be940a22b1.webm?t=1762922551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/e3cf7f68cfec4c460b957984a9ea3e09.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/e3cf7f68cfec4c460b957984a9ea3e09.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br>A twist on deckbuilders \u2014 The Cascadier turns your deck into explosive coin powers inside magical arcade machines. Charge your coins with elemental powers and unleash devastating combos with the powers of the gods. Combine them to create synergies and smash the coin shelves apart with Fireballs, Frostbolts, lightning, windy blasts, and light/dark empowered abilities.<i> </i> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/2fa98ff5a5a5a0b78a8f54c4104b225c.poster.avif?t=1762922551\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/2fa98ff5a5a5a0b78a8f54c4104b225c.webm?t=1762922551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/4809d73fbe637e219acde7f9fadb1e8a.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/4809d73fbe637e219acde7f9fadb1e8a.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each machine is an evolving pinball table packed with hidden ramps, mystery slots, and magical bumpers.\u00a0 Earn tickets with every run to unlock <strong>Trinkets</strong> hidden across the machines. Each one grants elemental-infused bonuses you can upgrade permanently through a skill tree, ensuring long-term progression. Stack multiple Trinkets to forge stronger builds and push toward the final machine where Fortuna, the Goddess of Fortune, awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/2dd357e24037eb4e0e958797cd1dc854.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/2dd357e24037eb4e0e958797cd1dc854.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The very first coin Fortuna gives you is unlike any other. It <strong>gains experience each time you win it back out of the machine</strong>, permanently unlocking new powers as it grows. This coin journeys through every cabinet, evolving with you across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To level it up, you\u2019ll need to <strong>win it back before each round ends</strong>\u2014a risky challenge that makes every playthrough feel fresh. Don\u2019t panic, though, the First Coin is never lost in a machine\u2014it always returns at the end of a run, stronger if you have earned it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/98e7ff3c98bd2022e5865a4dcae7dea6.poster.avif?t=1762922551\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/98e7ff3c98bd2022e5865a4dcae7dea6.webm?t=1762922551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/5db1e1ea42f82192db60c6c8a1f049eb.avif?t=1762922551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras_big/5db1e1ea42f82192db60c6c8a1f049eb.avif?t=1762922551 width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the sweet spot and trigger Euphoria Mode\u2014a chaotic burst of unlimited coins, skyrocketing scores, pulsing music, and dazzling effects. Every machine has its own theme and spectacle, so each burst of Euphoria feels wild in its own way.</p>","developers":["Enchanted Arcade"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/e6c38f00a0ca9f28fed05747342e50c26abcaf4d/header.jpg?t=1762922551","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Enchanted Arcade & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3553150/998644086/3b721bffa785814c86b5f1c12187826b8064c866/1759960028/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760026653","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3553150/998644086/3b721bffa785814c86b5f1c12187826b8064c866/1759960028/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760026653","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3553150/998644086/3b721bffa785814c86b5f1c12187826b8064c866/1759960028/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760026653","id":257210577,"name":"DEMO Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210577/9d10284edd19619f0c602c886065ccaf1b33abd4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760026653"}],"name":"The Cascadier","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-7500 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 or equivalent AMD Radeon<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["indie.io"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/ba058906cd967be915a9eaf9866d04a1f53ad67d/ss_ba0589